{"_id":"6a2fefdf2204ffbc59e5a39e","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"E_r4BLrSyHkrxpg4HDkUm","description":"# SQL Fundamentals\n\nSQL (Structured Query Language) is the standard language for querying relational databases. Data analysts use SQL to extract, filter, aggregate, and join data from databases before loading it into Python for further analysis. Python provides several libraries for running SQL queries directly from code.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"SQL Tutorial - Mode","url":"https://www.thoughtspot.com/sql-tutorial","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb4a"},{"type":"article","title":"SQL Tutorial","url":"https://www.sqltutorial.org/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb4b"},{"type":"video","title":"SQL Tutorial - Full Database Course for Beginners","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HXV3zeQKqGY","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb4c"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:28:15.189Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/E_r4BLrSyHkrxpg4HDkUm.md"}